Subject: [PATCH] Improve keepalive ping system

The server sent a keepalive every 2 seconds, accepted only a reply to
the newest one and smoothed ping with a 3/4 weighted average. Replies
slower than 2 seconds were all discarded, and ping spikes took about 8
seconds to show, which the high-ping knockback nerf depends on.

Send a keepalive every second, track every pending one, and report the
true average of the replies over the last 5 seconds (from Paper). The
reply arrives on the netty thread, so the shared state is synchronized.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: HaeImAlan <me@haeimalan.com>

